<h2 id="what-we-clear">What we clear</h2>
<ul>
<li>Kitchen sinks and garbage disposals</li>
<li>Showers, tubs and bathroom basins</li>
<li>Toilets and floor drains</li>
<li>Main sewer lines and outdoor drains</li>
</ul>
<h2 id="camera-inspection">Camera inspection</h2>
<p>On main lines we run a waterproof camera through the pipe after clearing it and show you the footage on a tablet. Roots, a sagging section and cracked joints are easy to spot. If the pipe needs repair, we give you a written price and you can take a few days to decide.</p>
<h2 id="keeping-drains-clear">Keeping drains clear</h2>
<p>Use a strainer in showers, keep grease and wipes out of the drains, and run hot water after using the disposal. Once a year, a maintenance flush on older sewer lines costs far less than an emergency call.</p>
